        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall: - \nTiled floor, large front aspect window.\n\nWC: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin, side aspect window.\n\nSun Lounge: - \nTiled floor, slide doors access lounge area.\n\nLounge: - \nParquet flooring, solid fuel stove.\n\nLiving Room: - \nHerringbone floor, front aspect window.\n\nStudio / Office: - \nSemi solid timber floor, front and side aspect windows.\n\nMain Bathroon: - \nFully tiled, wc, wash hand basin, bath, shower unit, rear aspect window.\n\nKitchen: - \nVinyl flooring, wall and floor kitchen cabinets, recess lighting, side aspect window.\n\nPantry: - \nVinyl flooring, shelved.\n\nUtility Room: - \nVinyl floor, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nCarpet on floor, rear and side aspect windows.\n\nWalk in Wardrobe: - \nCarpet on floor, built in clothes rails and shelving.\n\nEn Suite: - \nVinyl floor, tiled walls, wc, wash hand basin, shower unit, side aspect window.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nCarpet on floor, built in storage, stair case accessing loft space, side aspect window.\n\nLoft / Mezzanine: - \nCarpet on floor, velux window.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nCarpet on floor, front and side aspect windows.\n\n"
